"""The English homepage, as translatable units.

Each unit is a text node (or an element's inner HTML) of docs/index.html,
matched with its whitespace collapsed. make_home.py replaces every match with a
placeholder and fills it from home_<code>.py, so the English page stays the one
source of structure. If the English text changes and no longer matches, the
generator stops and says which unit, rather than shipping stale English.
"""

